174 instruments the probes asked for: family, home, sound (en, ru), the tag for a style; a tag clicked
goes into the style, ▶ A / ▶ B play the 60 s probes from the Collection, ✓ marks what Viktor kept in the
workspace Instrumental Probe, and those names go to the assistant as INSTRUMENTS HEARD ON THIS ENGINE.

